@host = http://localhost:3000

### Verificar saúde 
GET {{host}}/api/health

###Buscar métricas

GET {{host}}/api/dashboard

###Buscar faturas 

GET  {{host}}/api/invoices

###Buscar fatura pelo indentificador

GET {{host}}/api/invoices/195

###Criar fatura

POST {{host}}/api/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "amount": 125037,
    "status": "pending",
    "issueDate":"2026-10-01",
    "dueDate": "2026-10-31"
}

###Alterar Fatura

PUT {{host}}/api/invoices/195
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "amount": 125037,
    "status": "paid",
    "issueDate":"2026-10-02",
    "dueDate": "2026-10-31"
}

### Deletar fatura
DELETE {{host}}/api/invoices/195